    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def findDifference(self, nums1: List[int], nums2: List[int]) -> List[List[int]]:\r\n        s1, s2 = set(nums1), set(nums2)\r\n        return [list(s1 - s2), list(s2 - s1)]",
